{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-tou-qei-ou-kau-stou-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0432.12", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "Λαβὼν θεῖον ἄπυρον, λείψον σὺψ ἀφόρου · εἶτα λαβὼν ἄλμην"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-tou-qei-ou-kau-stou-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0432.13", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "δικαίαν, ἔψε ἕως ἐπιπλεύση, καὶ γίνεται ἄκαυστον. Δοκιμάζων καὶ"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-tou-qei-ou-kau-stou-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0432.14", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἐπαίρων καὶ βλέπων, (f. 279 v.) ἕως γένηται ἄκαυστον, ἕως ἴδῃς ὅτι"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-tou-qei-ou-kau-stou-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0432.15", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "οὐκέτι καίεται, καὶ λάβε τὸ αὐτὸ ὕδωρ ἄκαυστον, βάλε εἰς ἄλας"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-tou-qei-ou-kau-stou-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0432.16", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "ἄνθιον, λειῶν, ποιῶν ὡς τὸ θεῖον ἄκαυστον · τοῦτό ἐστιν τὸ θεῖον"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-tou-qei-ou-kau-stou-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0432.17", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "μυστήριον. Ἄλλοι δὲ μέλιδον τὸ θεῖον συνλείουσι ἀμὰ ἄλας ἄνθιον,"}
{"urn": "fragmenta-alchemica.peri-tou-qei-ou-kau-stou-e-cod-paris-b-n-gr-2327", "edition": "qwen36-berthelot_alchimistes_grec", "locus": "berthelot_alchimistes_grec_0432.18", "source": "ocr", "license": "PD", "text": "καὶ ποιοῦσι τὸ θεῖον μυστήριον."}
